ppspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2020%2F02%2Fhex-hire-TA-fb-4th.png?alt=media&token=89ce6151-fbb6-4463-87fd-363e0e5440b9",[22],{"title":41,"link":42,"date":43,"dateTime":44,"description":45,"thumbnail":46,"tags":47},"2019 年前端工程師薪資調查","\u002Fblog\u002F2020-01-03-2019-frontend-salary","2020\u002F01\u002F03","2020-01-03","大家好，我們是六角學院，至今已創校近四年，主要以線上程式影音課程，協助學員求職，成為前端工程師、網頁設計師。相信您也會想了解現今工程師的薪資發展是否具有前景，此篇我們就分享數據給各位參考。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2020%2F01%2F20191203_%E6%84%9F%E8%AC%9D%E7%A5%AD.001.png?alt=media&token=de6b720d-5468-4114-8d56-2d7eb13bccb7",[13],{"title":49,"link":50,"date":51,"dateTime":52,"description":53,"thumbnail":54,"tags":55},"w3HexSchool 鼠年全馬鐵人挑戰","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-11-14-w3hexschool-2020-challenge","2019\u002F11\u002F14","2019-11-14","這是由六角學院所推出的 w3HexSchool 活動，活動期限為一年，也就是 53 週，有如全馬挑戰一般，是屬於常態且長期性寫文活動，透過此活動進而推動自我成長及創造品牌形象！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F11%2Fw3HS%E9%90%B5%E4%BA%BA%E8%B3%BDbanner.png?alt=media&token=3f0ef8fd-6285-47ac-a159-83ff3fb3972e",[13],{"title":57,"link":58,"date":59,"dateTime":60,"description":37,"thumbnail":61,"tags":62},"【學員專屬徵才 - 第三波遠端助教】無工作經驗者優先錄取","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-11-05-remote-jobs-third","2019\u002F11\u002F05","2019-11-05","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F11%2Fhex-hire-TA-fb-3rd.png?alt=media&token=0fb5d150-3401-4380-80f5-8154dd74cd31",[22],{"title":64,"link":65,"date":66,"dateTime":67,"description":68,"thumbnail":69,"tags":70},"【大神來六角】十月直播主題：遠端接案","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-09-24-god-and-hexschool","2019\u002F09\u002F24","2019-09-24","遠端工作是這年來相當夯的題目之一，可以不進公司上班，也是許多人的夢想，尤其是工程師只要有電腦跟網路，到哪裡都可以工作。但是到底該如何踏出下一步呢？可能留在自己家鄉，遠端國內外的正職工作嗎？假使要遠端接案，該注意哪些細節呢？","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%